       "nodes": [\{"id":"1"\}, \{"id":"2"\}, \{"id":"3"\}],\
       "edges": [\{"source":"1", "target":"2"\}, \{"source":"2", "target":"3"\}]\
     \}\
     ```\
   - **Actual Server Response**:\
     ```json\
     \{"num_nodes": 3, "num_edges": 2, "is_dag": true\}\
     ```\
   - **Status**: **VERIFIED** (Accurately identified as a valid DAG).\
\
2. **Test Case B: Invalid Cyclic Graph**\
   - **Payload**: 2 mutually linked nodes forming a closed feedback loop (`1 -> 2 -> 1`).\
     ```json\
     \{\
       "nodes": [\{"id":"1"\}, \{"id":"2"\}],\
       "edges": [\{"source":"1", "target":"2"\}, \{"source":"2", "target":"1"\}]\
     \}\
     ```\
   - **Actual Server Response**:\
     ```json\
     \{"num_nodes": 2, "num_edges": 2, "is_dag": false\}\
     ```\
   - **Status**: **VERIFIED** (Accurately detected directed cycle and returned false).\
